ounty&rsquo;s 6 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and June to July and November to December each came in under 90% of normal in 39 of 75 years. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 142% of normal in June to July and 54% in October to November. On grid 25349, the driest year was 1988 at 55% of normal. A preliminary estimate puts August to September 2026 at 168.6 on that grid, and RMA&rsquo;s final index can differ.</p>"}
